-    **scan_kwargs,
-) -> List[SpaceTimeCluster]:
-    """Convenience wrapper: build the cell x day table from a raw
-    detections DataFrame (ideally
-    ``pyroscope.pipeline.fire_type.vegetation_fires_only(df)``, so static
-    sources never form a "cluster") and scan it.
